    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=zHx1Cn6jyRMmYxir]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=zHx1Cn6jyRMmYxir]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=zHx1Cn6jyRMmYxir]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]] (demons automatically succeed on this save).</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Unconscious apply=false] condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns. The target succeeds automatically after 10 minutes or if it takes damage or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to empty a flask of Holy Water on it.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s Drone for 24 hours.</p>",
